# Keys of bench.ts `Job` (jobs.Job (handlers/jobs.go GET /jobs/{id}, POST /jobs/{id}/cancel, POST /experiments/{id}/regrade)), one per line; a trailing ? marks an optional (Go omitempty) key.
# Hosted platform (U1 UI). A top-level response adds "mode". Change with bench.ts and the Go type.
id
org_id
kind
target?
status
params
progress?
result?
error?
created_by?
created_by_name?
created_at
started_at?
finished_at?
cancel_requested
attempt
lease_owner?
lease_until?
priority?
